      "description": {
        "fun": "Pumpkaboo is a jack-o'-lantern with a job: at sundown it gathers wandering spirits and carries them to the afterlife, even though it was born from a pumpkin holding a spirit stuck in this world. The light from its carved holes can hypnotise people, so approach a sleeping one with care. Its lore recalls Stingy Jack, who wandered the earth with a turnip lantern, the first jack-o'-lantern.",
        "guide": "Pumpkaboo is a Ghost- and Grass-type Pokémon from Kalos based on a Halloween jack-o'-lantern. It guides wandering spirits to the afterlife and can hypnotise with the light from its pumpkin. It comes in four sizes, which carry different kinds of spirits, and evolves into Gourgeist when traded.",
        "tagline": "A jack-o'-lantern that ferries lost souls to the afterlife",
