      "description": {
        "fun": "On new-moon nights, Gourgeist wanders the streets singing an eerie song, and anyone who hears it is cursed. It wraps prey in its hair-like arms and sings happily while it watches them struggle, and it may knock on doors before whisking people away, like a ghoulish trick-or-treater. Its candle-like head and dripping 'hair' look like the flame inside a jack-o'-lantern.",
        "guide": "Gourgeist is a Ghost- and Grass-type Pokémon that evolves from Pumpkaboo when traded. It roams towns on moonless nights singing a cursed song and catches prey with its long, hair-like arms. Like Pumpkaboo it comes in four sizes, each preferring different targets.",
        "tagline": "A pumpkin ghost whose new-moon song brings a curse",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Gourgeist (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Gourgeist_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
